    a: 'It depends on the size of the job and how much prep the site needs. Scarborough lots are often generous, which helps access and keeps prep straightforward. Every quote is free and in writing, so you know the exact price before work starts.',
  },
  {
    q: 'My bungalow driveway is original. Repair or replace?',
    a: 'If cracks are hairline and the slabs are still level, a repair can buy you years. If sections have heaved, settled or crumbled across most of the drive, replacement is the smarter spend. We will show you the evidence either way.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can you pour a driveway for a side lot or side entrance?',
    a: 'Yes. Scarborough side lots and side entrances are everyday work for us. We plan the layout so the concrete drains away from the house and meets the sidewalk cleanly.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you work near the Bluffs?',
    a: 'Yes. We serve the whole of Scarborough, from Birch Cliff and Cliffside up through Wexford, Bendale, Agincourt and Malvern. Homes near the lake take extra wind and moisture, and we spec base and finish with that in mind.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I get a Scarborough quote?',
    a: 'The free quote form is the fastest route: photos and a few details, and we reply with an estimate. You can also call us at (289) 906-0097.',
  },
