>
  <p>Scarborough is bungalow country. Postwar homes in Wexford, Bendale and Dorset Park sit on wide lots with double driveways poured decades ago, and after that many winters of salt and freeze-thaw, a lot of that original concrete is cracked, heaved or scaling. Down in Birch Cliff, Cliffside and Guildwood, homes near the Bluffs take wind and moisture off the lake all year, which is hard on any exterior surface. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> handles concrete work in Scarborough every week, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>The good news about Scarborough lots is room to work. Driveways are wide, side yards are accessible, and most jobs have space for proper excavation and base work. That matters, because the base is what decides whether your new driveway or walkway is still level in twenty years.</p>

  <h2>What we do on Scarborough streets</h2>
  <p>Scarborough calls tend to cluster around a few jobs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements of original postwar pours and new driveways for renovated homes</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Backyard patios</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">side walkways</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">front steps</a> repaired, resurfaced or rebuilt</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-sidewalks/">Sidewalk sections</a> replaced where they have heaved</li>
    <li><a href="/services/parging/">Parging</a> for foundation walls, plus <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a> work</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Every job starts with proper prep. We remove what has failed, compact a granular base, and pour a mix suited to our freeze-thaw climate. Prep is where cheap jobs cut corners, and it is why so much flatwork fails early. Ours is built to stay put.</p>

  <h2>Driveways, porches and steps, one visit</h2>
  <p>A lot of Scarborough homes need the same trio: driveway, front porch and steps. Because our crew handles all of it, you get one quote, one schedule and one cleanup, and the finishes match across the whole frontage. If your foundation coating is also flaking, we can add <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a> to the same visit.</p>

  <h2>Why Scarborough bungalow owners call us</h2>
  <p>Fifteen years of GTA concrete and a crew used to postwar lots. We will tell you honestly whether a driveway needs repair or full replacement, quote it in writing, and stick to the day we agree on.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A 2-year warranty on the whole job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed when we wrap up</li>
    <li>Free written quotes, zero pressure</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Getting started takes two minutes. Photos and a short description go through the form; the job then follows our clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a>. We also work next door in <a href="/locations/north-york/">North York</a> and east along the 401 into <a href="/locations/pickering/">Pickering</a>, so one call covers a family or rental property nearby.</p>
